  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accountable Grant with Water and Sanitation for the Urban Poor (WSUP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Accountable Grant with Water and Sanitation for the Urban Poor (WSUP) is a component of Water and Sanitation for the Urban Poor (WSUP) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;9,999,999. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Basic drinking water supply and basic sanitation, Waste management/disposal, Water supply and sanitation - large systems, Water sector policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
